<li about="#cite_note-329" id="cite_note-329" data-mw-footnote-number="325"><span class="mw-cite-backlink" id="mwGiU"><a href="#cite_ref-329" rel="mw:referencedBy" id="mwGiY"><span class="mw-linkback-text" id="mwGic">↑</span></a></span> <span id="mw-reference-text-cite_note-329" class="mw-reference-text reference-text"><link rel="mw-deduplicated-inline-style" href="mw-data:TemplateStyles:r1333433106" about="#mwt1184" typeof="mw:Extension/templatestyles" id="mwGig" data-mw='{"name":"templatestyles","attrs":{"src":"Module:Citation/CS1/styles.css"},"body":{"extsrc":""}}'/><cite id="CITEREFHyde2020" class="citation journal cs1">Hyde, Susan D. (2020). "Democracy's backsliding in the international environment". <i id="mwGik"><a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Science_(journal)" title="Science (journal)" id="mwGio">Science</a></i>. <b id="mwGis">369</b> (6508): <span class="nowrap" id="mwGiw">1192–</span>1196. <a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Bibcode_(identifier)" title="Bibcode (identifier)" class="mw-redirect" id="mwGi0">Bibcode</a>:<a rel="mw:ExtLink nofollow" href="https://ui.adsabs.harvard.edu/abs/2020Sci...369.1192H" class="external text" id="mwGi4">2020Sci...369.1192H</a>. <a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Doi_(identifier)" title="Doi (identifier)" class="mw-redirect" id="mwGi8">doi</a>:<a rel="mw:ExtLink nofollow" href="https://doi.org/10.1126%2Fscience.abb2434" class="external text" id="mwGjA">10.1126/science.abb2434</a>. <a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/PMID_(identifier)" title="PMID (identifier)" class="mw-redirect" id="mwGjE">PMID</a><span typeof="mw:Entity" id="mwGjI"> </span><a rel="mw:ExtLink nofollow" href="https://pubmed.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/32883862" class="external text" id="mwGjM">32883862</a>. <a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/S2CID_(identifier)" title="S2CID (identifier)" class="mw-redirect" id="mwGjQ">S2CID</a><span typeof="mw:Entity" id="mwGjU"> </span><a rel="mw:ExtLink nofollow" href="https://api.semanticscholar.org/CorpusID:221472047" class="external text" id="mwGjY">221472047</a>.</cite><span title="ctx_ver=Z39.88-2004&amp;rft_val_fmt=info%3Aofi%2Ffmt%3Akev%3Amtx%3Ajournal&amp;rft.genre=article&amp;rft.jtitle=Science&amp;rft.atitle=Democracy%27s+backsliding+in+the+international+environment&amp;rft.volume=369&amp;rft.issue=6508&amp;rft.pages=1192-1196&amp;rft.date=2020&amp;rft_id=info%3Adoi%2F10.1126%2Fscience.abb2434&amp;rft_id=https%3A%2F%2Fapi.semanticscholar.org%2FCorpusID%3A221472047%23id-name%3DS2CID&amp;rft_id=info%3Apmid%2F32883862&amp;rft_id=info%3Abibcode%2F2020Sci...369.1192H&amp;rft.aulast=Hyde&amp;rft.aufirst=Susan+D.&amp;rfr_id=info%3Asid%2Fen.wikipedia.org%3ADemocracy" class="Z3988" id="mwGjc"></span></span></li>
